{
  "name": "tnt_breaks_minecarts",
  "description": "TNT goes off among minecarts on an obsidian floor. A hit adds ten times the explosion's damage to a cart's damage, which falls by 1 a tick, and past 40 the cart breaks. The four carts two blocks away break: the plain and furnace carts drop their items, and the chest and hopper carts spill what they hold before their own item drops (drawing a place for every slot twice). Two plain carts 7.5 blocks away, on activator rails, take about 28 damage. The one on an unpowered rail is only shaken; the one on a powered rail breaks, since the rail keeps its damage between 41 and 50.",
